                        str += "当场上有角色受到属性伤害后，你P概率随机获得一个技能。<br><br>";
                        
                        str += "<b>【特定牌说明】</b><br>";
                        str += "• 火【杀】：标准包5张<br>";
                        str += "• 火【攻】：标准包3张<br>";
                        str += "• 雷【杀】：标准包9张<br>";
                        str += "• 【闪电】：标准包2张<br>";
                        str += "• 【铁索连环】：标准包6张<br>";
                        str += "共计：25张<br><br>";
                        
                        str += "<b>【当前牌堆统计】</b><br>";
                        str += `• 火【杀】：${cardDetails.fireSha}张<br>`;
                        str += `• 火【攻】：${cardDetails.huogong}张<br>`;
                        str += `• 雷【杀】：${cardDetails.thunderSha}张<br>`;
                        str += `• 【闪电】：${cardDetails.shandian}张<br>`;
                        str += `• 【铁索连环】：${cardDetails.tiesuo}张<br>`;
                        str += `<b>合计：${targetCardCount}张</b><br><br>`;
                        
                        str += "<b>【当前触发概率】</b><br>";
                        str += `• P概率：${probabilityP}%（${targetCardCount}/25）<br>`;
                        str += `• Q概率：${probabilityQ}%（${targetCardCount}/${allCards.length}）<br><br>`;
                        
